     "defaultValue": false,
     "value": "<p class=\" p1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Quand la </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.spiceevents.fr/performances-techniques-son-and-lumieres\" data-type=\"undefined\" target=\"_self\"><u><strong>technique</strong></u></a></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong> devient un support à l’émotion</strong></span></p>",
